(227419, 13490, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, subject, color, clarity, brightness, and composition, this shot has it all!  The snow on the ground MADE this shot - it just wouldn''t have had the same impact for me if that had been grass.  The snow gives the shot an almost surreal quality. Very cool. 10</td>', 'Wow, subject, color, clarity, brightness, and composition, this shot has it all!  The snow on the ground MADE this shot - it just wouldn''t have had the same impact for me if that had been grass.  The snow gives the shot an almost surreal quality. Very cool. 10', '2003-03-03 10:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
