(227456, 13422, 2553, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this shot just doesn''t do a lot for me.  The "leading lines" (roof) takes up less than half the shot, and doesn''t have a lot of impact.  There are quite a few distractions - the  upper edge of the road with the grass and the curb, the car on the right, and the bushes - and for me, they all detract from the "leading lines" theme.  I would have considered shooting from the top of the roof down at the gentleman, down close to the roof to try to make the lines the largest part of the composition.  Good lighting, nice clear, well focused shot otherwise.</td>', 'Sorry, this shot just doesn''t do a lot for me.  The "leading lines" (roof) takes up less than half the shot, and doesn''t have a lot of impact.  There are quite a few distractions - the  upper edge of the road with the grass and the curb, the car on the right, and the bushes - and for me, they all detract from the "leading lines" theme.  I would have considered shooting from the top of the roof down at the gentleman, down close to the roof to try to make the lines the largest part of the composition.  Good lighting, nice clear, well focused shot otherwise.', '2003-03-03 10:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
