(227688, 13248, 4501, '<td valign="top">Nice shot ,don,t like the weird angle</td>', 'Nice shot ,don,t like the weird angle', '2003-03-03 13:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(227692, 13277, 3447, '<td valign="top">Artistic firewood.  Photo appears grainy (no pun intended).  Meets challenge well.</td>', 'Artistic firewood.  Photo appears grainy (no pun intended).  Meets challenge well.', '2003-03-03 13:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(227697, 13520, 3447, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge well.  Bleak landscape appears to be tilted to right.  Good DOF.</td>', 'Fits challenge well.  Bleak landscape appears to be tilted to right.  Good DOF.', '2003-03-03 13:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(227706, 13490, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice -- quite a fun image!  Is this Cedar Point, by chance?  Whatever the case, I think it meets the challenge very well.  Brings to mind the phrase "organized chaos."</td>', 'Very nice -- quite a fun image!  Is this Cedar Point, by chance?  Whatever the case, I think it meets the challenge very well.  Brings to mind the phrase "organized chaos."', '2003-03-03 13:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(227709, 13277, 3102, '<td valign="top">A neat idea, and well composed!  Seems like it may have been a little over-sharpened, though.</td>', 'A neat idea, and well composed!  Seems like it may have been a little over-sharpened, though.', '2003-03-03 13:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(227711, 13318, 3102, '<td valign="top">The contrast seems just a little too strong for my tastes, but I still like this shot a lot.  I''ve been finding myself attracted to railways for photos myself lately!</td>', 'The contrast seems just a little too strong for my tastes, but I still like this shot a lot.  I''ve been finding myself attracted to railways for photos myself lately!', '2003-03-03 13:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(227715, 13429, 3102, '<td valign="top">Probably a bit more sky than I would have preferred, but still a good shot for the challenge!</td>', 'Probably a bit more sky than I would have preferred, but still a good shot for the challenge!', '2003-03-03 13:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(227716, 13519, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Meets the challenge to a tee.  I think the toning is quite appropriate here, too.</td>', 'Excellent shot!  Meets the challenge to a tee.  I think the toning is quite appropriate here, too.', '2003-03-03 13:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(227719, 13267, 3102, '<td valign="top">Super composure -- and it really stands out well in B&amp;W.  Way to go! -9</td>', 'Super composure -- and it really stands out well in B&W.  Way to go! -9', '2003-03-03 13:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(227720, 13336, 5865, '<td valign="top">I liked the photograph a lot.  The line of the bridge does lead you into the photograph very strongly.  The lighting seems a little unfortunate and my end tended to stop where the shadow began, which seemed to work against the idea behind the line, but I still enjoyed the scene.</td>', 'I liked the photograph a lot.  The line of the bridge does lead you into the photograph very strongly.  The lighting seems a little unfortunate and my end tended to stop where the shadow began, which seemed to work against the idea behind the line, but I still enjoyed the scene.', '2003-03-03 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(227722, 13470, 3102, '<td valign="top">The tree seems a little too centered here, but I still love the shot.  I like the way the ravine leads to the tree, and the curves of the hill are a great addition.</td>', 'The tree seems a little too centered here, but I still love the shot.  I like the way the ravine leads to the tree, and the curves of the hill are a great addition.', '2003-03-03 13:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(227724, 13423, 5865, '<td valign="top">It seemed a nice idea to have the line of the boat reflected in the car bodywork.  I thought the  side mirror was working against the overall effect of the image though and this frustrated me a little.  A good idea though.</td>', 'It seemed a nice idea to have the line of the boat reflected in the car bodywork.  I thought the  side mirror was working against the overall effect of the image though and this frustrated me a little.  A good idea though.', '2003-03-03 13:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(227726, 13313, 5865, '<td valign="top">A simple and effective composition.  The colour seemed a good addition to the shot.  I was wondering if the photograph would be improved by having everything in sharp focus.  I didn''t think that the chosen depth of field helped in any way.  Good idea though.</td>', 'A simple and effective composition.  The colour seemed a good addition to the shot.  I was wondering if the photograph would be improved by having everything in sharp focus.  I didn''t think that the chosen depth of field helped in any way.  Good idea though.', '2003-03-03 13:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(227727, 13328, 3102, '<td valign="top">But where are the lines???  (Just kidding!)  Great abstract shot.  The only thing I would have liked would be a nice blue sky... but that certainly doesn''t happen often enough!</td>', 'But where are the lines???  (Just kidding!)  Great abstract shot.  The only thing I would have liked would be a nice blue sky... but that certainly doesn''t happen often enough!', '2003-03-03 13:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(227730, 13218, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think it was a good idea and I thought having the shadow of the cue on the table was a plus.  However, the orange ball in the bottom left-hand corner of the shot seemed to be working agains the idea of the line of the cue leading the eye into the shot.  It might have been better placed further into the frame.</td>', 'I think it was a good idea and I thought having the shadow of the cue on the table was a plus.  However, the orange ball in the bottom left-hand corner of the shot seemed to be working agains the idea of the line of the cue leading the eye into the shot.  It might have been better placed further into the frame.', '2003-03-03 13:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(227731, 13197, 3102, '<td valign="top">I *almost* did something similar with some highways in Pittsburgh, but I went a different direction -- nice job!</td>', 'I *almost* did something similar with some highways in Pittsburgh, but I went a different direction -- nice job!', '2003-03-03 13:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(227733, 13477, 5865, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photograph of the horses and I always enjoy the use of reflections, however I couldn''t see a strong line in the photograph.</td>', 'It''s a nice photograph of the horses and I always enjoy the use of reflections, however I couldn''t see a strong line in the photograph.', '2003-03-03 13:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(227734, 13387, 3102, '<td valign="top">The idea is a good one, but there are a couple things that distract me.  The biggest thing is that the colors appear to be *way* oversaturated -- they''re just too harsh and blown out.  The other is that I would have preferred that the woman hadn''t had her whole back amputated in the shot.  Probably would have been stronger to have gotten her entirely within the frame.</td>', 'The idea is a good one, but there are a couple things that distract me.  The biggest thing is that the colors appear to be *way* oversaturated -- they''re just too harsh and blown out.  The other is that I would have preferred that the woman hadn''t had her whole back amputated in the shot.  Probably would have been stronger to have gotten her entirely within the frame.', '2003-03-03 13:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(227737, 13204, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like they all posed for this -- good eye!</td>', 'Looks like they all posed for this -- good eye!', '2003-03-03 13:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(227738, 13330, 5865, '<td valign="top">Some may argue that the image is a bit of a cliche, but I really love this shot.  The eye really knows where it is going and after the eye is led into the photograph there is a lot of stuff to keep it interested; the buildings and then the hills in the background.  I also liked the very straight horizontal line of the edge of the field which was placed in a good compositional position.  I also liked the contrast between the deep green of the field and the light blue sky.  Very nice photograph.</td>', 'Some may argue that the image is a bit of a cliche, but I really love this shot.  The eye really knows where it is going and after the eye is led into the photograph there is a lot of stuff to keep it interested; the buildings and then the hills in the background.  I also liked the very straight horizontal line of the edge of the field which was placed in a good compositional position.  I also liked the contrast between the deep green of the field and the light blue sky.  Very nice photograph.', '2003-03-03 13:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(227741, 13429, 5865, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea with the line of the bridge leading to the flag, however there is a lot of stuff that seems to be competing with that line and it tends to make the image a little confusing to look at.  The line  caused by the pavement and the people walking along that pavement for instance.  A good idea though.</td>', 'This is a good idea with the line of the bridge leading to the flag, however there is a lot of stuff that seems to be competing with that line and it tends to make the image a little confusing to look at.  The line  caused by the pavement and the people walking along that pavement for instance.  A good idea though.', '2003-03-03 13:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(227742, 13362, 3102, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a little weak, but it''s an interesting composition and a great idea!</td>', 'The colors seem a little weak, but it''s an interesting composition and a great idea!', '2003-03-03 13:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(227746, 13285, 3102, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet creative.  Nicely executed.</td>', 'Simple, yet creative.  Nicely executed.', '2003-03-03 13:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(227748, 13287, 3102, '<td valign="top">In all honesty, the effects don''t add to the photo for me here.</td>', 'In all honesty, the effects don''t add to the photo for me here.', '2003-03-03 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(227750, 13405, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can see what you''re going for here, and it strikes me as a reasonably good abstract shot.  But I feel that this challenge was for us to use lines to lead viewers'' eyes through a shot, and this doesn''t really do that... to me it''s just a squiggly line without much more to support it.</td>', 'I can see what you''re going for here, and it strikes me as a reasonably good abstract shot.  But I feel that this challenge was for us to use lines to lead viewers'' eyes through a shot, and this doesn''t really do that... to me it''s just a squiggly line without much more to support it.', '2003-03-03 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(227752, 13427, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot and the right idea.<br/>Personally I think there is so much going on here it''s hard for eye to land in one spot.<br/>Great colors.</td>', 'Pretty shot and the right idea.Personally I think there is so much going on here it''s hard for eye to land in one spot.Great colors.', '2003-03-03 14:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(227753, 13337, 327, '<td valign="top">Good find and on subject.<br/>Focus and light are not great but I like the idea here.</td>', 'Good find and on subject.Focus and light are not great but I like the idea here.', '2003-03-03 14:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(227754, 13330, 327, '<td valign="top">I almost did this same (simular) shot. You did it well.<br/>Good work.</td>', 'I almost did this same (simular) shot. You did it well.Good work.', '2003-03-03 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(227757, 13217, 327, '<td valign="top">O''yeah. Good shooting.</td>', 'O''yeah. Good shooting.', '2003-03-03 14:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(227758, 13267, 327, '<td valign="top">Good shooting, love the texture, tones and feel.</td>', 'Good shooting, love the texture, tones and feel.', '2003-03-03 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(227760, 13416, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shooting, lovely view, tones, light. Nice.</td>', 'Pretty shooting, lovely view, tones, light. Nice.', '2003-03-03 14:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(227761, 13313, 327, '<td valign="top">Thomas...love him. :)</td>', 'Thomas...love him. :)', '2003-03-03 14:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(227763, 13442, 327, '<td valign="top">Like it..really a good feeling, mood, light.</td>', 'Like it..really a good feeling, mood, light.', '2003-03-03 14:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(227764, 13350, 327, '<td valign="top">Exellent shot...love it.</td>', 'Exellent shot...love it.', '2003-03-03 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(227768, 13357, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful....<br/>just amazing light, curve.</td>', 'Wonderful....just amazing light, curve.', '2003-03-03 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(227777, 13420, 6405, '<td valign="top">It is very soft light and out of focus 3 from me</td>', 'It is very soft light and out of focus 3 from me', '2003-03-03 14:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(227780, 13475, 6405, '<td valign="top">I was told on my submission that leading lines should take me to a subject and that is why I''m getting low scores, but i like your photo without subject!</td>', 'I was told on my submission that leading lines should take me to a subject and that is why I''m getting low scores, but i like your photo without subject!', '2003-03-03 14:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(227782, 13287, 6405, '<td valign="top">A negative of a tree photo, don''t think is meeting the challenge!</td>', 'A negative of a tree photo, don''t think is meeting the challenge!', '2003-03-03 14:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(227785, 13323, 6405, '<td valign="top">I would focus the whole thing, 9 from me...</td>', 'I would focus the whole thing, 9 from me...', '2003-03-03 14:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(227788, 13202, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and nice contrast ,but I was told on my photo that I need an subject on the end of the leading line?</td>', 'Beautiful photo and nice contrast ,but I was told on my photo that I need an subject on the end of the leading line?', '2003-03-03 14:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(227790, 13204, 5865, '<td valign="top">I loved this photograph.  The line just led the eye through the whole of the image.  The colours make a good contrast to the image and I love the seagull at the front standing up.  He looks like the leader of the whole pack.  Great shot.</td>', 'I loved this photograph.  The line just led the eye through the whole of the image.  The colours make a good contrast to the image and I love the seagull at the front standing up.  He looks like the leader of the whole pack.  Great shot.', '2003-03-03 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(227793, 13470, 5508, '<td valign="top">That looks like a nice place. Good shot.</td>', 'That looks like a nice place. Good shot.', '2003-03-03 14:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(227794, 13429, 5508, '<td valign="top">Where''s the snow?</td>', 'Where''s the snow?', '2003-03-03 14:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(227798, 13427, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall it''s a nice, sharp image, but something bothers me a little about it.  After looking at it for a bit, I guess the thing that''s troubling me is that there''s no clear subject here.  Is the subject the railing, the river, the bridge or the buildings?  My interpretation of the challenge is that the lines should lead the eyes through the image, but in this case it seems like there''s not a specific place for the eye to come to a rest...?  Does this make any sense?  :)</td>', 'Overall it''s a nice, sharp image, but something bothers me a little about it.  After looking at it for a bit, I guess the thing that''s troubling me is that there''s no clear subject here.  Is the subject the railing, the river, the bridge or the buildings?  My interpretation of the challenge is that the lines should lead the eyes through the image, but in this case it seems like there''s not a specific place for the eye to come to a rest...?  Does this make any sense?  :)', '2003-03-03 14:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(227805, 13377, 2344, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Very nice</td>', 'Simple and effective. Very nice', '2003-03-03 14:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(227808, 13201, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro leading lines idea.. you need something that the lines are leading to... something at the end of the blade(s) of grass..</td>', 'Very nice macro leading lines idea.. you need something that the lines are leading to... something at the end of the blade(s) of grass..', '2003-03-03 15:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(227810, 13437, 2344, '<td valign="top">A slight tilt so the stem comes right out of the corner and a more exaggerated diagonal would have made this a 10. Otherwise, very nice!</td>', 'A slight tilt so the stem comes right out of the corner and a more exaggerated diagonal would have made this a 10. Otherwise, very nice!', '2003-03-03 15:01:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(227811, 13218, 2344, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Just a tip... to help your subject stand out, get rid of the other balls. Did you try a more extreme diagonal?</td>', 'Great idea! Just a tip... to help your subject stand out, get rid of the other balls. Did you try a more extreme diagonal?', '2003-03-03 15:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(227813, 13285, 2344, '<td valign="top">I really love this image. You obviously got the point of the challenge! Congrats! 10</td>', 'I really love this image. You obviously got the point of the challenge! Congrats! 10', '2003-03-03 15:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(227817, 13335, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love the colours!</td>', 'Very nice! Love the colours!', '2003-03-03 15:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(227818, 13323, 2344, '<td valign="top">Love it! 10. very original idea!</td>', 'Love it! 10. very original idea!', '2003-03-03 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(227819, 13267, 2344, '<td valign="top">Crop at the top and bottom of the fence and you''ll have a stronger image. no need to include the building at the top</td>', 'Crop at the top and bottom of the fence and you''ll have a stronger image. no need to include the building at the top', '2003-03-03 15:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(227820, 13357, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Simple and effective. and I like the cropping too 9</td>', 'Very nice! Simple and effective. and I like the cropping too 9', '2003-03-03 15:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(227822, 13336, 2344, '<td valign="top">very nice 9. I would have used a slightly tighter crop at the top to keep the focus on the bridge and not the other trees.</td>', 'very nice 9. I would have used a slightly tighter crop at the top to keep the focus on the bridge and not the other trees.', '2003-03-03 15:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(227825, 13367, 2344, '<td valign="top">you''ve got the right idea. Billiard balls are so colourful, why not use it?</td>', 'you''ve got the right idea. Billiard balls are so colourful, why not use it?', '2003-03-03 15:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(227826, 13405, 2344, '<td valign="top">I dont really get it. There are lines, but they dont really lead to anything.</td>', 'I dont really get it. There are lines, but they dont really lead to anything.', '2003-03-03 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(227827, 13248, 2344, '<td valign="top">I think this church also has problems with its foundation! Look how bad it''s leaning over! :P</td>', 'I think this church also has problems with its foundation! Look how bad it''s leaning over! :P', '2003-03-03 15:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(227829, 13366, 2344, '<td valign="top">the tracks leading to nowhere is exactly what i dont like about this image. leading lines should lead to something.. draw your eye to the important part of the image.. and this case it leads to nothing...</td>', 'the tracks leading to nowhere is exactly what i dont like about this image. leading lines should lead to something.. draw your eye to the important part of the image.. and this case it leads to nothing...', '2003-03-03 15:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(227834, 13387, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the saturation is a bit too much.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the saturation is a bit too much.', '2003-03-03 15:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(227858, 13507, 2223, '<td valign="top">This is pretty. I would really like to know how you got the shading border.</td>', 'This is pretty. I would really like to know how you got the shading border.', '2003-03-03 16:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(227860, 13337, 772, '<td valign="top">Don''t mess with texas :)  the diagonal here is nice and the leading lines are ok.. the more dominant lines lead out of the frame... - setzler</td>', 'Don''t mess with texas :)  the diagonal here is nice and the leading lines are ok.. the more dominant lines lead out of the frame... - setzler', '2003-03-03 16:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(227861, 13423, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract and nice use of reflections :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting abstract and nice use of reflections :) - setzler', '2003-03-03 16:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(227862, 13217, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent architectural shot.. the perspective is nice.. -- setzler</td>', 'excellent architectural shot.. the perspective is nice.. -- setzler', '2003-03-03 16:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(227866, 13366, 327, '<td valign="top">I expected to see many more railroad shots and held back from shooting it myself.<br/>Your shot is really very VERY well done. I''m glad I didn''t attempt tracks. Nice work, love the crop, tones. Clapping!!!</td>', 'I expected to see many more railroad shots and held back from shooting it myself.Your shot is really very VERY well done. I''m glad I didn''t attempt tracks. Nice work, love the crop, tones. Clapping!!!', '2003-03-03 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(227868, 13489, 327, '<td valign="top">Orignial, colorful. Nice work.</td>', 'Orignial, colorful. Nice work.', '2003-03-03 16:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(227869, 13285, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you came up with this....? Amazing brain activitiy. :) I love this shot, it''s on target, colorful and interesting. Yeah for you.</td>', 'I don''t know how you came up with this....? Amazing brain activitiy. :) I love this shot, it''s on target, colorful and interesting. Yeah for you.', '2003-03-03 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(227871, 13370, 327, '<td valign="top">Just intriguing, great light, focus.</td>', 'Just intriguing, great light, focus.', '2003-03-03 16:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(227873, 13470, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot..well done.<br/>Clapping for you!!!!!!</td>', 'Stunning shot..well done.Clapping for you!!!!!!', '2003-03-03 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(227875, 13299, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay,,, looked, left came back to this. I like it.<br/>The focus and light are perfect. I wish his feet were not cut off. I''m nit picking here I know. Also I see this tilted a tad bit.........................Beyond that little stuff** This is just a wonderful photo. BRAVO.</td>', 'Okay,,, looked, left came back to this. I like it.The focus and light are perfect. I wish his feet were not cut off. I''m nit picking here I know. Also I see this tilted a tad bit.........................Beyond that little stuff** This is just a wonderful photo. BRAVO.', '2003-03-03 16:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(227876, 13519, 327, '<td valign="top">intriguing/stunning.<br/>Maybe a tad dark. <br/>Good work.</td>', 'intriguing/stunning.Maybe a tad dark. Good work.', '2003-03-03 16:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(227878, 13310, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot. Good focus.</td>', 'Stunning shot. Good focus.', '2003-03-03 16:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
