(227952, 13370, 5865, '<td valign="top">I thought that this photograph was great.  I like the lighting.  Having the ceiling so dark provides a very strong line that leads the eye into the image.  The columns to the left add a great perspective to the shot and the shadow of the columns falling across the scene break up an otherwise dull part of the photograph.  The depth of field is good too.  If it was too narrow it would have spoiled the shot.  Great.</td>', 'I thought that this photograph was great.  I like the lighting.  Having the ceiling so dark provides a very strong line that leads the eye into the image.  The columns to the left add a great perspective to the shot and the shadow of the columns falling across the scene break up an otherwise dull part of the photograph.  The depth of field is good too.  If it was too narrow it would have spoiled the shot.  Great.', '2003-03-03 17:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(227959, 13312, 5865, '<td valign="top">I thought this was lovely.  It would have been awful without that brown thingy sticking out into the sea, but with the brown thingy there it really makes a great photo.  It is well composed using the rule of thirds.  The colours are great and the greenery of foreground adds interest.  Very nice indeed.</td>', 'I thought this was lovely.  It would have been awful without that brown thingy sticking out into the sea, but with the brown thingy there it really makes a great photo.  It is well composed using the rule of thirds.  The colours are great and the greenery of foreground adds interest.  Very nice indeed.', '2003-03-03 17:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(228028, 13328, 656, '<td valign="top">Would be perfect with a subject within that lower left sqare</td>', 'Would be perfect with a subject within that lower left sqare', '2003-03-03 18:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
