(228102, 13370, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice.  i like the shadows too.  only complaint would be that the gate is hard to differentiate from the closer columns.</td>', 'nice.  i like the shadows too.  only complaint would be that the gate is hard to differentiate from the closer columns.', '2003-03-03 19:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(228118, 13455, 2352, '<td valign="top">I do like this shot for the lines challenge. There are lots of lines with the road, trees, and fences. Almost too many lines in a way that keeps them from drawing the eye to the subject.  The road starts to draw the eye to the house, but the trees stops them. The fence is too far away to pick up the eyes again to draw them to the house. Overall an excellent shot with crisp focus and colors that work well together. Well done!  -Clicker-</td>', 'I do like this shot for the lines challenge. There are lots of lines with the road, trees, and fences. Almost too many lines in a way that keeps them from drawing the eye to the subject.  The road starts to draw the eye to the house, but the trees stops them. The fence is too far away to pick up the eyes again to draw them to the house. Overall an excellent shot with crisp focus and colors that work well together. Well done!  -Clicker-', '2003-03-03 19:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(228128, 13310, 2352, '<td valign="top">Although there are lines in this shot, they do not draw my eyes to the subject. ( I assume the guy ) I like the use of black and white here. Good focus!    -Clicker-</td>', 'Although there are lines in this shot, they do not draw my eyes to the subject. ( I assume the guy ) I like the use of black and white here. Good focus!    -Clicker-', '2003-03-03 19:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(228138, 13337, 2352, '<td valign="top">It is difficult to tell what  the subject is here. I assume the barrels? The lines do not really draw my eye to them. Although the challenge is `lines`, they are used to draw the eye to the subject and not be the total emphasis of the shot. Interesting lighting use here. I like that!   -Clicker-</td>', 'It is difficult to tell what  the subject is here. I assume the barrels? The lines do not really draw my eye to them. Although the challenge is `lines`, they are used to draw the eye to the subject and not be the total emphasis of the shot. Interesting lighting use here. I like that!   -Clicker-', '2003-03-03 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(228145, 13526, 2352, '<td valign="top">I am just not into the over processed color look. I am not sure if you are doing that to compensate for the lack of focus on the line to the flower or not. The idea of the shot is good.  -Clicker-</td>', 'I am just not into the over processed color look. I am not sure if you are doing that to compensate for the lack of focus on the line to the flower or not. The idea of the shot is good.  -Clicker-', '2003-03-03 19:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
