(228201, 13284, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great use of the challenge.  Love the warm colors, composition and the lines truly lead to the focal point.  I might have chosen a tighter crop in the upper left, and a little less exposure on the flowers, but I''m sure your entry is doing better than mine!!  8</td>', 'Great use of the challenge.  Love the warm colors, composition and the lines truly lead to the focal point.  I might have chosen a tighter crop in the upper left, and a little less exposure on the flowers, but I''m sure your entry is doing better than mine!!  8', '2003-03-03 20:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
