(228261, 13500, 2352, '<td valign="top">I see lines, but they don`t deliver an impact. What is your subject?  What are the lines trying to draw my eyes to?  There is a nice sharp focus and color scheme. But what is the focus of the picture trying to show?  -Clicker-</td>', 'I see lines, but they don`t deliver an impact. What is your subject?  What are the lines trying to draw my eyes to?  There is a nice sharp focus and color scheme. But what is the focus of the picture trying to show?  -Clicker-', '2003-03-03 21:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
