(229389, 13197, 6325, '<td valign="top">Composition is pretty good. Tones are flat for me and the lines do not take me anywhere particular - they just go everywhere.</td>', 'Composition is pretty good. Tones are flat for me and the lines do not take me anywhere particular - they just go everywhere.', '2003-03-05 00:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(229393, 13470, 6325, '<td valign="top">Pretty hill. I would have put the big tree more to the left rather than so centered.  My eye goes to the line of the hill and it does not bring me back to the tree. The gulley does go to the tree, but I see the tree first and then notice the foreground.</td>', 'Pretty hill. I would have put the big tree more to the left rather than so centered.  My eye goes to the line of the hill and it does not bring me back to the tree. The gulley does go to the tree, but I see the tree first and then notice the foreground.', '2003-03-05 00:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(229395, 13423, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure in the snow and dark spots. But too confusing to me.</td>', 'Nice exposure in the snow and dark spots. But too confusing to me.', '2003-03-05 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
