(229491, 13429, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and perspective of the bridge. I am led right to the flag.</td>', 'Nice picture and perspective of the bridge. I am led right to the flag.', '2003-03-05 05:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
