(229497, 13236, 3306, '<td valign="top">I am not sure this picture satisfies the theme. I can only imagine what you are thinking but it is not clear.</td>', 'I am not sure this picture satisfies the theme. I can only imagine what you are thinking but it is not clear.', '2003-03-05 05:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(229498, 13525, 3585, '<td valign="top">since the leading line is also the main feature in this composition, It would have benefited from a wider range of tones on it. good use of negative space.</td>', 'since the leading line is also the main feature in this composition, It would have benefited from a wider range of tones on it. good use of negative space.', '2003-03-05 05:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(229499, 13470, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''m not a member yet so I can''t vote on this challenge.  If I could you''de be getting a 10.  I looked at all the other pictures and this is the only comment I''m giving.  If you don''t win I''ll shit myself!  Great Job.  This might be my favorite picture I''ve seen yet on here.  I must remember to come back and mark it as a favorite on Sunday.</td>', 'I''m not a member yet so I can''t vote on this challenge.  If I could you''de be getting a 10.  I looked at all the other pictures and this is the only comment I''m giving.  If you don''t win I''ll shit myself!  Great Job.  This might be my favorite picture I''ve seen yet on here.  I must remember to come back and mark it as a favorite on Sunday.', '2003-03-05 05:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(229500, 13470, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like your leading line. The crooked creek takes me right to the tree. I like the accent of the curved hill in the backround. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice. I like your leading line. The crooked creek takes me right to the tree. I like the accent of the curved hill in the backround. Good job.', '2003-03-05 05:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(229501, 13277, 3585, '<td valign="top">nice shot, perhaps a little overgenerous with sharpening</td>', 'nice shot, perhaps a little overgenerous with sharpening', '2003-03-05 05:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(229502, 13477, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a very good, well balanced picture. I really like the reflection of the horses in the pond. Your leading lines do not  lead me to the subjects though. They only seem to be a backdrop. Besides the fact that it doesn''t seem to satisfy the theme, I like your picture alot.</td>', 'This is a very good, well balanced picture. I really like the reflection of the horses in the pond. Your leading lines do not  lead me to the subjects though. They only seem to be a backdrop. Besides the fact that it doesn''t seem to satisfy the theme, I like your picture alot.', '2003-03-05 05:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(229503, 13349, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cute expression. Good portrait. To satisfy the theme I wish you had backed up a little and shown more of the leading line.</td>', 'Cute expression. Good portrait. To satisfy the theme I wish you had backed up a little and shown more of the leading line.', '2003-03-05 05:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(229504, 13360, 3585, '<td valign="top">without the appeal of the house''s colors, the leading lines would drive you srtaight out of the picture.</td>', 'without the appeal of the house''s colors, the leading lines would drive you srtaight out of the picture.', '2003-03-05 05:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(229505, 13490, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great color. Looks like a painting. You are right; your leading lines are misleading but I love the picture anyway.</td>', 'Great color. Looks like a painting. You are right; your leading lines are misleading but I love the picture anyway.', '2003-03-05 05:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(229506, 13472, 3306, '<td valign="top">The curved wall takes my eye directly to the bridge. definitely satisfies the theme.</td>', 'The curved wall takes my eye directly to the bridge. definitely satisfies the theme.', '2003-03-05 05:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(229508, 13323, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I think I personally would have liked it better if the handle of the brush were a little more in focus. I like the angle and perspective of the subject and the soft colors. The red in the paste really draws the viewer to the subject.</td>', 'Good idea. I think I personally would have liked it better if the handle of the brush were a little more in focus. I like the angle and perspective of the subject and the soft colors. The red in the paste really draws the viewer to the subject.', '2003-03-05 05:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(229509, 13357, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well executed. Definitely satisfies the theme. The blue sky really helps to draw the viewers eye from the leading lines to the subject.</td>', 'Well executed. Definitely satisfies the theme. The blue sky really helps to draw the viewers eye from the leading lines to the subject.', '2003-03-05 05:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(229510, 13520, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, would convey a much better sense of open space without this mean border that traps you in the frame.</td>', 'Nice capture, would convey a much better sense of open space without this mean border that traps you in the frame.', '2003-03-05 05:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(229512, 13231, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting leading line. It takes the viewer up to the sky and then down to the subject. I like the way the truck also seems to point to the subjects.</td>', 'Very interesting leading line. It takes the viewer up to the sky and then down to the subject. I like the way the truck also seems to point to the subjects.', '2003-03-05 05:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(229513, 13388, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective and interpretation of the theme. Excellent shot. The picture has a very warm and quiet feeling to it. The young lady''s yellow shirt really helps your leading lines draw the viewer  to the subject. Even the chandelier seems to point to her. This is my favorite shot of the week. Great job!</td>', 'Very interesting perspective and interpretation of the theme. Excellent shot. The picture has a very warm and quiet feeling to it. The young lady''s yellow shirt really helps your leading lines draw the viewer  to the subject. Even the chandelier seems to point to her. This is my favorite shot of the week. Great job!', '2003-03-05 05:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(229514, 13437, 3585, '<td valign="top">This dark border makes it like looking through a window from the inside. A lighter or no border at all would allow the viewer to wander more and imagine the surroundings where its eye is lead and give a greater sense of space to the composition.</td>', 'This dark border makes it like looking through a window from the inside. A lighter or no border at all would allow the viewer to wander more and imagine the surroundings where its eye is lead and give a greater sense of space to the composition.', '2003-03-05 05:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(229515, 13330, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting picture. I am fascinated by the fact that even though your middle row is centered at the bottom of the picture it flows to the right so that more of the field show up on the left side of the picture. It makes it more interesting. One of my top 3 picks this week. Good job</td>', 'This is a very interesting picture. I am fascinated by the fact that even though your middle row is centered at the bottom of the picture it flows to the right so that more of the field show up on the left side of the picture. It makes it more interesting. One of my top 3 picks this week. Good job', '2003-03-05 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(229516, 13285, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very crisp. I like the curviness of your leading line. It is more interesting than if you had used just a straight line. The white against the blue really helps it stand out. One of my top 3 picks this week. Good shot.</td>', 'Very crisp. I like the curviness of your leading line. It is more interesting than if you had used just a straight line. The white against the blue really helps it stand out. One of my top 3 picks this week. Good shot.', '2003-03-05 05:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(229517, 13420, 3585, '<td valign="top">I like that one, would work even better if flipped horizontally, to have the begining of lead in the lower left corner (just the way our eyes are trained)</td>', 'I like that one, would work even better if flipped horizontally, to have the begining of lead in the lower left corner (just the way our eyes are trained)', '2003-03-05 06:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(229519, 13335, 3585, '<td valign="top">The International Commitee for the Preservation of Yellows and Reds denounces with vigor this act of deliberate discrimination. Good shot otherwise. I like the monopod creature in the back.</td>', 'The International Commitee for the Preservation of Yellows and Reds denounces with vigor this act of deliberate discrimination. Good shot otherwise. I like the monopod creature in the back.', '2003-03-05 06:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(229520, 13357, 1829, '<td valign="top">TOP SHOT - Excellent leading lines photo and great perspective as well.  You certainly have an eye for this.  I like how the lines leading to the end is all the same colour and the blue at the end really stands out.  Again an excellent shot which deserves a 10.  Well done.</td>', 'TOP SHOT - Excellent leading lines photo and great perspective as well.  You certainly have an eye for this.  I like how the lines leading to the end is all the same colour and the blue at the end really stands out.  Again an excellent shot which deserves a 10.  Well done.', '2003-03-05 06:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(229521, 13442, 3585, '<td valign="top">Good range of tones, textures and colors. An quiet atmosphere of privacy.</td>', 'Good range of tones, textures and colors. An quiet atmosphere of privacy.', '2003-03-05 06:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(229527, 13201, 1280, '<td valign="top">Enchanting, and well done.</td>', 'Enchanting, and well done.', '2003-03-05 08:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(229533, 13475, 1280, '<td valign="top">that fence has character!  Good textural image, good color.</td>', 'that fence has character!  Good textural image, good color.', '2003-03-05 08:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(229536, 13377, 1280, '<td valign="top">The lines are  very good.  It''s hard to tell it''s frost.  Perhaps  a closer shot.</td>', 'The lines are  very good.  It''s hard to tell it''s frost.  Perhaps  a closer shot.', '2003-03-05 08:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(229537, 13318, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice comosition and framing. Focus is good.  Moody.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice comosition and framing. Focus is good.  Moody.  I like it.', '2003-03-05 08:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(229542, 13490, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wowie!!!  Colorfully meets the challenge.  Nice!</td>', 'Wowie!!!  Colorfully meets the challenge.  Nice!', '2003-03-05 08:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(229551, 13248, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful architecture, well seen and recorded.  But why the tilt?  I don\''t see how it adds anything positive to the image. Your exposure, and focus are very good.  Would have scored higher if it didn''t tilt.</td>', 'Beautiful architecture, well seen and recorded.  But why the tilt?  I don\''t see how it adds anything positive to the image. Your exposure, and focus are very good.  Would have scored higher if it didn''t tilt.', '2003-03-05 08:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(229595, 13267, 4793, '<td valign="top">Love this in Black &amp; w. works well for the challenge, beautiful.</td>', 'Love this in Black & w. works well for the challenge, beautiful.', '2003-03-05 09:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(229610, 13470, 6182, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in this challenge!   10   ... The only thing that would make this photo greater is a more saturated sky blue color.</td>', 'This is my favorite in this challenge!   10   ... The only thing that would make this photo greater is a more saturated sky blue color.', '2003-03-05 10:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(229611, 13285, 6182, '<td valign="top">Really fun idea...very creative!   I like the color, shapes, texture, good lighting, nice focus... all around great photograph!  10</td>', 'Really fun idea...very creative!   I like the color, shapes, texture, good lighting, nice focus... all around great photograph!  10', '2003-03-05 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(229613, 13330, 6182, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favorites in this challenge!   Very well thought out shot...10!</td>', 'Definitely one of my favorites in this challenge!   Very well thought out shot...10!', '2003-03-05 10:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(229614, 13336, 6182, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!    I''d like it better if the lighting was more similar on the two sides where you can see the cable but it''s difficult when you are working with natural light sources!   Focus could be better but it''s a great subject and an interesting idea.  I might crop out some of the trees at the top  to place subject more in the center of the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot!    I''d like it better if the lighting was more similar on the two sides where you can see the cable but it''s difficult when you are working with natural light sources!   Focus could be better but it''s a great subject and an interesting idea.  I might crop out some of the trees at the top  to place subject more in the center of the shot.', '2003-03-05 10:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(229621, 13524, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot for the challenge.  I see the leading lines.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great shot for the challenge.  I see the leading lines.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(229622, 13277, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!  I love the logs as the leading line. The colors and textures are awesome.</td>', 'Great shot!!  I love the logs as the leading line. The colors and textures are awesome.', '2003-03-05 11:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(229623, 13357, 714, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge, but would like a better subject to look at to get a 10 from me.  I give you a vote of 7.  Good luck.  This is a great picture!</td>', 'This meets the challenge, but would like a better subject to look at to get a 10 from me.  I give you a vote of 7.  Good luck.  This is a great picture!', '2003-03-05 11:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(229625, 13330, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I love the colors and the time of day you chose.  I would like the subject to be more visible though.  I love the framing.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I love the colors and the time of day you chose.  I would like the subject to be more visible though.  I love the framing.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(229626, 13442, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2003-03-05 11:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(229627, 13489, 714, '<td valign="top">Great perspective shot, but I don''t see a subject to make it leading lines.</td>', 'Great perspective shot, but I don''t see a subject to make it leading lines.', '2003-03-05 11:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(229628, 13520, 714, '<td valign="top">I see the leading lines are leading my eyes to the mountains.  Very nice.  I like the grey tones.  Very pretty picture.  Good luck.</td>', 'I see the leading lines are leading my eyes to the mountains.  Very nice.  I like the grey tones.  Very pretty picture.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(229630, 13479, 714, '<td valign="top">Yes it meets the challenge, but would like more of a distictive line.  The background is a little distracting too.  All things aside.  I do like this shot.  The colors are wonderful.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yes it meets the challenge, but would like more of a distictive line.  The background is a little distracting too.  All things aside.  I do like this shot.  The colors are wonderful.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(229631, 13335, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective shot, but not for leading lines.  And if that blur at the end is supposed to be the subject. you might try to have them stand still.</td>', 'Nice perspective shot, but not for leading lines.  And if that blur at the end is supposed to be the subject. you might try to have them stand still.', '2003-03-05 11:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(229632, 13210, 714, '<td valign="top">So the inside of the flower is the subject or is the flower the subject.  I guess it could be leading lines but It doesn''t do anything for me. The focus seems a bit off.  Good luck.</td>', 'So the inside of the flower is the subject or is the flower the subject.  I guess it could be leading lines but It doesn''t do anything for me. The focus seems a bit off.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(229633, 13475, 714, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this meets the challenge.  Where is the subject?  The lines and subject are supposed to be two different things.</td>', 'I don''t see how this meets the challenge.  Where is the subject?  The lines and subject are supposed to be two different things.', '2003-03-05 11:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(229634, 13221, 714, '<td valign="top">This does meet the challenge.  The bird is really out of focus.  They are hard to shoot.  Try setting your shutter speed faster.  Good luck.</td>', 'This does meet the challenge.  The bird is really out of focus.  They are hard to shoot.  Try setting your shutter speed faster.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(229636, 13429, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Maybe try to take the picture at another time of the day to get better lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Maybe try to take the picture at another time of the day to get better lighting.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(229637, 13267, 714, '<td valign="top">I have mixed feeling on this shot whether it meets the challenge or not.  If the subject is the building then yes it does, but is that what you want me to look at?<br/>I like it in b/w.  Good luck. I am going to vote as I like it. Vote 7</td>', 'I have mixed feeling on this shot whether it meets the challenge or not.  If the subject is the building then yes it does, but is that what you want me to look at?I like it in b/w.  Good luck. I am going to vote as I like it. Vote 7', '2003-03-05 11:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(229638, 13211, 714, '<td valign="top">You have two leading lines here.  The fence and the road.  The fence however leads my eyes to the bushes, but the road leads my eyes to the house.  Very pretty place to live.  Good luck.</td>', 'You have two leading lines here.  The fence and the road.  The fence however leads my eyes to the bushes, but the road leads my eyes to the house.  Very pretty place to live.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(229640, 13236, 714, '<td valign="top">I guess you could say there is leading lines here. But I am sure we could find leading lines in almost every picture we look at.  I am looking for more that the lines stand out and then lead your eyes to the subject.  We shouldn''t have to find the lines first.  :-)</td>', 'I guess you could say there is leading lines here. But I am sure we could find leading lines in almost every picture we look at.  I am looking for more that the lines stand out and then lead your eyes to the subject.  We shouldn''t have to find the lines first.  :-)', '2003-03-05 11:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(229641, 13454, 714, '<td valign="top">My eyes are led right to the reflection. Nice photo colorful photo for being winter.  Good luck.</td>', 'My eyes are led right to the reflection. Nice photo colorful photo for being winter.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 11:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(229642, 13416, 714, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture.  It is interesting to look at. The tones are wonderful.  Maybe a better subject besides the light to make it more of leading lines.  because without the title I would no what the subject was.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very pretty picture.  It is interesting to look at. The tones are wonderful.  Maybe a better subject besides the light to make it more of leading lines.  because without the title I would no what the subject was.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 12:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(229643, 13336, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I like the lighting on the fence.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice picture.  I like the lighting on the fence.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 12:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(229645, 13284, 714, '<td valign="top">You did a good job of meeting the challenge.  I like the red tones in the picture. I would like the flowers to be a bit more in focus though.  Good job and good luck.</td>', 'You did a good job of meeting the challenge.  I like the red tones in the picture. I would like the flowers to be a bit more in focus though.  Good job and good luck.', '2003-03-05 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(229646, 13323, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love it.  I love the way you put the toothpaste on.  I also like the reflection. The background is good.  You get a 10 from me.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love it.  I love the way you put the toothpaste on.  I also like the reflection. The background is good.  You get a 10 from me.  Good luck.', '2003-03-05 12:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(229647, 13360, 714, '<td valign="top">I am having to guess here at where the leading lines are.  There are lots of lines, but none of them leading my eyes to a subject.</td>', 'I am having to guess here at where the leading lines are.  There are lots of lines, but none of them leading my eyes to a subject.', '2003-03-05 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(229648, 13388, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!!  She has gorgious red hair.  The focus is just right. vote 9</td>', 'Very nice!!!!  She has gorgious red hair.  The focus is just right. vote 9', '2003-03-05 12:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(229650, 13310, 714, '<td valign="top">I am having to guess at which is the lines I am supposed to look at to lead me to the subject.  I shouldnt have to do that.</td>', 'I am having to guess at which is the lines I am supposed to look at to lead me to the subject.  I shouldnt have to do that.', '2003-03-05 12:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(229651, 13285, 714, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I like the lighting and the shadows.  vote 9</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I like the lighting and the shadows.  vote 9', '2003-03-05 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(229652, 13337, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!!  vote 9</td>', 'Great shot!!!  vote 9', '2003-03-05 12:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(229653, 13293, 714, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. My eyes are being led out of the picture. There are just to many lines.  It confuses the eyes.<br/></td>', 'I don''t get it. My eyes are being led out of the picture. There are just to many lines.  It confuses the eyes.', '2003-03-05 12:13:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(229654, 13218, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The photo seems a bit grainy because of bad lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The photo seems a bit grainy because of bad lighting.', '2003-03-05 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(229655, 13455, 714, '<td valign="top">There are definitly a lot of leading lines here.  This is a great picture.  I would like more of one line leading my eye to the subject though.</td>', 'There are definitly a lot of leading lines here.  This is a great picture.  I would like more of one line leading my eye to the subject though.', '2003-03-05 12:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(229656, 13197, 714, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines going in all different directions.  Where is the subject?</td>', 'Lots of lines going in all different directions.  Where is the subject?', '2003-03-05 12:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(229657, 13217, 714, '<td valign="top">Where is the subject?  I like the shot and the color tones.</td>', 'Where is the subject?  I like the shot and the color tones.', '2003-03-05 12:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(229658, 13470, 714, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot so far.  I love the colors, textures and I like how the leading line is bent up.  vote 10!</td>', 'This is my favorite shot so far.  I love the colors, textures and I like how the leading line is bent up.  vote 10!', '2003-03-05 12:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(229659, 13367, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and the sepia look.</td>', 'I like the focus and the sepia look.', '2003-03-05 12:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(229660, 13519, 714, '<td valign="top">Really good picture.  maybe try at a different time of the day to get more shadowing from the fence, but this is very nice.</td>', 'Really good picture.  maybe try at a different time of the day to get more shadowing from the fence, but this is very nice.', '2003-03-05 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(229662, 13470, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I wonder if you could have composed this differently, with the tree not centered in the frame.  Good strong leading lines, excellent color and exposure.</td>', 'Good shot, but I wonder if you could have composed this differently, with the tree not centered in the frame.  Good strong leading lines, excellent color and exposure.', '2003-03-05 12:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(229664, 13442, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good shot. The light as well as the lines draw the viewer''s eye to the subject.</td>', 'Good shot. The light as well as the lines draw the viewer''s eye to the subject.', '2003-03-05 12:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(229665, 13389, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Great light, lines, and exposure.</td>', 'Excellent. Great light, lines, and exposure.', '2003-03-05 12:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(229667, 13360, 3102, '<td valign="top">My only complaint here is that the white line and bars seems to lead the viewers'' eyes away from the shot instead of into it.  Just a thought...</td>', 'My only complaint here is that the white line and bars seems to lead the viewers'' eyes away from the shot instead of into it.  Just a thought...', '2003-03-05 12:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(229705, 13336, 2553, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the challenge!  I really like the composition, and the lighting that you had that day was pretty good - if I was wishing, I''d wish for more light on the other side of the bridge, but working with what the situation was, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Perfect for the challenge!  I really like the composition, and the lighting that you had that day was pretty good - if I was wishing, I''d wish for more light on the other side of the bridge, but working with what the situation was, I like it a lot.', '2003-03-05 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(229708, 13284, 3447, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge well.  Flowers would benefit from sharper focus.</td>', 'Meets challenge well.  Flowers would benefit from sharper focus.', '2003-03-05 13:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(229717, 13201, 3447, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp photograph.  Details too busy to focus on a leading line.</td>', 'Nice sharp photograph.  Details too busy to focus on a leading line.', '2003-03-05 13:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
