(230283, 13477, 6771, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the fence was suppose to be the line, but the waters edge works better.  Great capture of the reflections.  dropping the exposure some would darken it up a but and allow  there to be some richer colors</td>', 'Not sure if the fence was suppose to be the line, but the waters edge works better.  Great capture of the reflections.  dropping the exposure some would darken it up a but and allow  there to be some richer colors', '2003-03-06 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
