(230291, 13437, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF and focus.  May have a little better look if the stem came from the left lower and then  the head ending at the top right third</td>', 'Very good DOF and focus.  May have a little better look if the stem came from the left lower and then  the head ending at the top right third', '2003-03-06 07:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(230292, 13419, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice lines to the ranch.  Would like more DOF to accentuate the corrals and barns.  Nice capture with all that snow</td>', 'Nice lines to the ranch.  Would like more DOF to accentuate the corrals and barns.  Nice capture with all that snow', '2003-03-06 07:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(230293, 13221, 6771, '<td valign="top">Little birdy is a bit fuzzy, but lines do draw you to the corner and to focus on the subject</td>', 'Little birdy is a bit fuzzy, but lines do draw you to the corner and to focus on the subject', '2003-03-06 07:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(230294, 13362, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Round "lines"  maybe a touch brighter light that would bring out the luminance of the glass</td>', 'Nice idea.  Round "lines"  maybe a touch brighter light that would bring out the luminance of the glass', '2003-03-06 07:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(230295, 13370, 6771, '<td valign="top">Drawn to the gate, for sure.  Tad bright on the ground, made it darker above.  The detail in the roof above (beams etc) would have brought out the picture even more.</td>', 'Drawn to the gate, for sure.  Tad bright on the ground, made it darker above.  The detail in the roof above (beams etc) would have brought out the picture even more.', '2003-03-06 07:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
