(230298, 13197, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lines throughout.  Get that feeling of going nowhere when I get on those things.  But then I am kind of a hick.  (C:  Too bad not a clearer day</td>', 'Very interesting lines throughout.  Get that feeling of going nowhere when I get on those things.  But then I am kind of a hick.  (C:  Too bad not a clearer day', '2003-03-06 07:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
