(230300, 13387, 6771, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the over saturation is purposeful, but made the bench area distracting and I almost missed the woman and dog altogether.</td>', 'Not sure if the over saturation is purposeful, but made the bench area distracting and I almost missed the woman and dog altogether.', '2003-03-06 07:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
