(230312, 13416, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo.  only thing I see is that the building (where is seems the lines lead) seems to have "dodged" out a touch too much</td>', 'Very pretty photo.  only thing I see is that the building (where is seems the lines lead) seems to have "dodged" out a touch too much', '2003-03-06 07:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
