(230315, 13330, 6771, '<td valign="top">this one almost scares me.  Having been up and down those innumerable times.  nice composition. hard to tell where the focus is.  seems a bit soft all the way through.  7</td>', 'this one almost scares me.  Having been up and down those innumerable times.  nice composition. hard to tell where the focus is.  seems a bit soft all the way through.  7', '2003-03-06 07:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
