(230320, 13479, 6771, '<td valign="top">very interesting motion photo.  can''t tell if it is turning round and different looks on the back of the flags or there are a bunch of em</td>', 'very interesting motion photo.  can''t tell if it is turning round and different looks on the back of the flags or there are a bunch of em', '2003-03-06 07:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230321, 13472, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice lines down the edge of the river to the bridge.  a polarizing filter might drop off a bit of the shine off the middle of the river, but keep the waves there.   How did it look in color?</td>', 'Nice lines down the edge of the river to the bridge.  a polarizing filter might drop off a bit of the shine off the middle of the river, but keep the waves there.   How did it look in color?', '2003-03-06 07:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(230322, 13218, 6771, '<td valign="top">nice "draw" down the cue.  the light seems a bit on the dull side, and a touch warm.  the nine ball looks like it has a orange cast in the white.  a focus on the cue ball with it fuzzing out around the rest would emphasize the "shot"</td>', 'nice "draw" down the cue.  the light seems a bit on the dull side, and a touch warm.  the nine ball looks like it has a orange cast in the white.  a focus on the cue ball with it fuzzing out around the rest would emphasize the "shot"', '2003-03-06 07:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
