(230332, 13337, 6771, '<td valign="top">nice lighting that progressivlely darkens towards the top left, but leaves the TX barrels lit.</td>', 'nice lighting that progressivlely darkens towards the top left, but leaves the TX barrels lit.', '2003-03-06 07:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(230333, 13440, 6771, '<td valign="top">nice use of lines, down to the cars.  the snow on the left is a little too brilliant.  adjusting exp comp some may help</td>', 'nice use of lines, down to the cars.  the snow on the left is a little too brilliant.  adjusting exp comp some may help', '2003-03-06 08:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(230334, 13299, 6771, '<td valign="top">two different sets of lines leading to this good ol boy.  nice use of the b&amp;w</td>', 'two different sets of lines leading to this good ol boy.  nice use of the b&w', '2003-03-06 08:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(230376, 13507, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. The border really does this justice. Well done!</td>', 'Very beautiful. The border really does this justice. Well done!', '2003-03-06 10:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(230383, 13405, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat abstract.  I love the graduated colors...the punch of orangey-red...and that odd sperm-like squiggle across the bottom.  Unfortunately, it doesn''t seem to be too strong of a leading line to me :(</td>', 'This is a really neat abstract.  I love the graduated colors...the punch of orangey-red...and that odd sperm-like squiggle across the bottom.  Unfortunately, it doesn''t seem to be too strong of a leading line to me :(', '2003-03-06 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(230384, 13519, 1856, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b&amp;w...love the patterns, textures, and tones.</td>', 'Beautiful b&w...love the patterns, textures, and tones.', '2003-03-06 10:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(230485, 13349, 1379, '<td valign="top">The red looks really strong against the muted background.  Interesting.</td>', 'The red looks really strong against the muted background.  Interesting.', '2003-03-06 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(230486, 13427, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great, strong leading line, but.... it keeps leading my eye over to the right side of the frame, and there''s nothing really interesting over there.  More interesting is the blue building on the other bank.</td>', 'Great, strong leading line, but.... it keeps leading my eye over to the right side of the frame, and there''s nothing really interesting over there.  More interesting is the blue building on the other bank.', '2003-03-06 12:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(230523, 13336, 3974, '<td valign="top">Great photography, makes me feel in this place.</td>', 'Great photography, makes me feel in this place.', '2003-03-06 14:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(230552, 13472, 51167, '<td valign="top">wow, this is great.  The ripples and the wall both lead your eye back to the bridge.  Beautiful shot!</td>', 'wow, this is great.  The ripples and the wall both lead your eye back to the bridge.  Beautiful shot!', '2003-03-06 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230553, 13350, 51167, '<td valign="top">wow this is great.</td>', 'wow this is great.', '2003-03-06 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(230613, 13472, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. I like it how the embankment carries me trough the frame and keeps my eye at the more interesting right side with its foliage. The crop on the right is a bit tight. The bridge finishes it off.</td>', 'Nice landscape. I like it how the embankment carries me trough the frame and keeps my eye at the more interesting right side with its foliage. The crop on the right is a bit tight. The bridge finishes it off.', '2003-03-06 15:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230615, 13429, 3032, '<td valign="top">Altough the lines lead to the flag it is not clear that the flag is the main subject because of those lines. This image is more about the bridge itself, with an interesting play of lines. Doesn''t mean I don''t like it, because I do.<br/>Have you considered another crop/frame, less sky, more of the centre of the image to get a better composition and to use the two middle lines better and get a better lead to the flag itself. The image doesn''t need the two outher lines. I''d cut it off right inside the two safetygates on the outer lines, leave the bottom in and cut off some sky.</td>', 'Altough the lines lead to the flag it is not clear that the flag is the main subject because of those lines. This image is more about the bridge itself, with an interesting play of lines. Doesn''t mean I don''t like it, because I do.Have you considered another crop/frame, less sky, more of the centre of the image to get a better composition and to use the two middle lines better and get a better lead to the flag itself. The image doesn''t need the two outher lines. I''d cut it off right inside the two safetygates on the outer lines, leave the bottom in and cut off some sky.', '2003-03-06 16:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(230618, 13470, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice how the crack in the ground carries the eyer from the lower left corner to the trees. The branch in the lower right also play''s a role by pointing to the upper left. Fun how the upper part of the tree works with the line of the hill.<br/>Great color.<br/>I might have cut off a little bit from the left. Good photo.</td>', 'Nice how the crack in the ground carries the eyer from the lower left corner to the trees. The branch in the lower right also play''s a role by pointing to the upper left. Fun how the upper part of the tree works with the line of the hill.Great color.I might have cut off a little bit from the left. Good photo.', '2003-03-06 16:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(230620, 13389, 3032, '<td valign="top">Frankfurt?<br/>Nice photo, the lines work well. The lighting must have been difficult for getting a good exposure, possible highlighl blow-out on the train while still getting enough shadow detail. And that''s the only problem here.<br/>I would have liked to see more detail in the goodbey sayers, I can see from their body language that they are no passengers, but it would have just been a little bit better with more detail (I know that this was impossible). What would work with this lighting is when someone was also poking his/her head out of the door. <br/>While I say this I think I see that the doors are closing? Not smart to put your head out at that moment. :)<br/> <br/>Anyway, I like it. Good luck.</td>', 'Frankfurt?Nice photo, the lines work well. The lighting must have been difficult for getting a good exposure, possible highlighl blow-out on the train while still getting enough shadow detail. And that''s the only problem here.I would have liked to see more detail in the goodbey sayers, I can see from their body language that they are no passengers, but it would have just been a little bit better with more detail (I know that this was impossible). What would work with this lighting is when someone was also poking his/her head out of the door. While I say this I think I see that the doors are closing? Not smart to put your head out at that moment. :) Anyway, I like it. Good luck.', '2003-03-06 16:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(230622, 13231, 3032, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting leading line. :)<br/>I like the concept and the technical quality of this photo, but think that the composition could be improved with a shooting angle more to the left, to get a better balance between the vehicle and the construction site. The big arm trough the blue sky is a very cool subject. Good luck.</td>', 'That''s an interesting leading line. :)I like the concept and the technical quality of this photo, but think that the composition could be improved with a shooting angle more to the left, to get a better balance between the vehicle and the construction site. The big arm trough the blue sky is a very cool subject. Good luck.', '2003-03-06 16:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(230624, 13388, 3032, '<td valign="top">Image with a good impact on the viewer. The subject is clearly the reading girl, both subject placing and the leading lines makes the image work in that respect.<br/>Leading lines are the balustrade and the arch/pillar in the upper right section.<br/>Lighting and exposure is great and the yellow shirt makes the subject stand out from the classic surroundings. The dark left side works well, it enhances the other composition techniques to keep the eye in the right side of the frame.<br/>Good job, one of my favourites.<br/> <br/>O yeah, I remember something else. Het activity has a leading line as well and that is the line between her eyes and the book. It communicates that she is fully occupied by her book, perhaps didn''t even notice the photographer. When she would have looked up the magic moment would have gone and the photo wouldn''t have worked as well as it has now.</td>', 'Image with a good impact on the viewer. The subject is clearly the reading girl, both subject placing and the leading lines makes the image work in that respect.Leading lines are the balustrade and the arch/pillar in the upper right section.Lighting and exposure is great and the yellow shirt makes the subject stand out from the classic surroundings. The dark left side works well, it enhances the other composition techniques to keep the eye in the right side of the frame.Good job, one of my favourites. O yeah, I remember something else. Het activity has a leading line as well and that is the line between her eyes and the book. It communicates that she is fully occupied by her book, perhaps didn''t even notice the photographer. When she would have looked up the magic moment would have gone and the photo wouldn''t have worked as well as it has now.', '2003-03-06 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(230628, 13442, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great use of the fence and what I find particularly cool in this shot is the foliage in the upper right corner working as a frame and the big open sky in the upper left where the subject is looking at. The invisible line and balance between the face/body position and the sky is also something that makes this image communicate its meaning very well.</td>', 'Great use of the fence and what I find particularly cool in this shot is the foliage in the upper right corner working as a frame and the big open sky in the upper left where the subject is looking at. The invisible line and balance between the face/body position and the sky is also something that makes this image communicate its meaning very well.', '2003-03-06 16:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(230629, 13349, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice how the rock-wall leads to the girl. Good composition. The red shirt and blue pants makes her stand out from the dark branches. The tip of the shoes are a nice touch.<br/>One possible improvement is a dramatically wider aperture to make the branches in the background a complete blur, providing even better contrast for the subject and keeping all attention on her. It would also blur the wall in the foreground, but that is not a problem.</td>', 'Nice how the rock-wall leads to the girl. Good composition. The red shirt and blue pants makes her stand out from the dark branches. The tip of the shoes are a nice touch.One possible improvement is a dramatically wider aperture to make the branches in the background a complete blur, providing even better contrast for the subject and keeping all attention on her. It would also blur the wall in the foreground, but that is not a problem.', '2003-03-06 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(230632, 13204, 3032, '<td valign="top">Funny photo, great subjects. :)<br/>The poles lead the eye trough the frame, good job.<br/> <br/>Exposure is a bit on the bright side, some highlight blowouts on the torso''s of the birds and loss of detail on the bolts. A 1/3th-2/3th EV exposure compensation (or a one to two steps -not stop!- faster shutter does the same) could solve that. It is only a minor issue.</td>', 'Funny photo, great subjects. :)The poles lead the eye trough the frame, good job. Exposure is a bit on the bright side, some highlight blowouts on the torso''s of the birds and loss of detail on the bolts. A 1/3th-2/3th EV exposure compensation (or a one to two steps -not stop!- faster shutter does the same) could solve that. It is only a minor issue.', '2003-03-06 16:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(230640, 13350, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Altough I keep saying that it is a dull image that leads to nothing it still works. The perspective of the curved concrete that bends away and frames the foliage-texture at the left looks better and better _the more time_ I spend looking at it.<br/>I''d say that only the upper line of the conrete is the leading line, the rest is a framer and subject on its own. Very nice, not dull at all. :)<br/>Exposure is good, detail in the shadows and no visible highlight blowouts.<br/>The image looks oversharpend though, a lot of diagonal jaggies. I have seen it only on oversharpened images and D1x 200% blowups. :)<br/></td>', 'Interesting composition. Altough I keep saying that it is a dull image that leads to nothing it still works. The perspective of the curved concrete that bends away and frames the foliage-texture at the left looks better and better _the more time_ I spend looking at it.I''d say that only the upper line of the conrete is the leading line, the rest is a framer and subject on its own. Very nice, not dull at all. :)Exposure is good, detail in the shadows and no visible highlight blowouts.The image looks oversharpend though, a lot of diagonal jaggies. I have seen it only on oversharpened images and D1x 200% blowups. :)', '2003-03-06 16:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(230642, 13211, 3032, '<td valign="top">This is a good leading line, but I think the house is a bit too close to the edge of the frame. I wouldn''t mind sacrificing a bit of the fence at the left for a bit more space at the right. Nice background, it shows what setting the house is in. <br/>Good exposure.</td>', 'This is a good leading line, but I think the house is a bit too close to the edge of the frame. I wouldn''t mind sacrificing a bit of the fence at the left for a bit more space at the right. Nice background, it shows what setting the house is in. Good exposure.', '2003-03-06 16:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230651, 13285, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the simple colors, and how the texture is shown.  Great use of shadows.</td>', 'I love the simple colors, and how the texture is shown.  Great use of shadows.', '2003-03-06 17:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(230652, 13475, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the two "opposing" lines meet in  one place.</td>', 'I like how the two "opposing" lines meet in  one place.', '2003-03-06 17:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(230653, 13362, 811, '<td valign="top">I love how the marbles are going up into an abyss.  Reminds me of standing in line at Walt Disney World for Space Mountain, or something.</td>', 'I love how the marbles are going up into an abyss.  Reminds me of standing in line at Walt Disney World for Space Mountain, or something.', '2003-03-06 17:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(230655, 13267, 811, '<td valign="top">I like how the wall and bricks meet together to draw the eye into the picture.  I don''t know if it was intentional or not, but about halfway up, the bricks'' pattern changes adn the eye is taken further to the right (at least mine is) on to the "back" of the picture.  Very effective at moving the eyes around.  Good use of bw.</td>', 'I like how the wall and bricks meet together to draw the eye into the picture.  I don''t know if it was intentional or not, but about halfway up, the bricks'' pattern changes adn the eye is taken further to the right (at least mine is) on to the "back" of the picture.  Very effective at moving the eyes around.  Good use of bw.', '2003-03-06 17:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230656, 13335, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the blue and the repeating pattern.  Very strong feeling, yet mysterious.</td>', 'I love the blue and the repeating pattern.  Very strong feeling, yet mysterious.', '2003-03-06 17:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(230658, 13330, 811, '<td valign="top">The lines really draw the eyes up and to the farm.  Nice colors and details, as well.</td>', 'The lines really draw the eyes up and to the farm.  Nice colors and details, as well.', '2003-03-06 17:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(230661, 13477, 811, '<td valign="top">I think it is interesting that the lines in this shot lead the eyes one way (right to left with back fence) then the other (to the right with the edge of the water and horses) back to the left with the different color of water, and then they rest, somehow on the white part of the fence in the lower right. In my opinion, maybe cropping that little piece of fence out would let more attention to to the horses.</td>', 'I think it is interesting that the lines in this shot lead the eyes one way (right to left with back fence) then the other (to the right with the edge of the water and horses) back to the left with the different color of water, and then they rest, somehow on the white part of the fence in the lower right. In my opinion, maybe cropping that little piece of fence out would let more attention to to the horses.', '2003-03-06 17:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(230666, 13470, 7160, '<td valign="top">This photo is beautiful!</td>', 'This photo is beautiful!', '2003-03-06 17:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(230668, 13470, 4871, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph - Such a serene picture interrupted by chaos. Well done!</td>', 'I love this photograph - Such a serene picture interrupted by chaos. Well done!', '2003-03-06 18:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(230672, 13490, 7073, '<td valign="top">Awesome Picture</td>', 'Awesome Picture', '2003-03-06 18:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(230866, 13318, 3280, '<td valign="top">Lines are good but I''m not sure what subject that they are leading to.  Grey border may be a bit too much.</td>', 'Lines are good but I''m not sure what subject that they are leading to.  Grey border may be a bit too much.', '2003-03-06 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(230868, 13490, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great colors but I don''t think the lines are leading to anything.  The whole thing is a bit busy.</td>', 'Great colors but I don''t think the lines are leading to anything.  The whole thing is a bit busy.', '2003-03-06 22:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(230869, 13455, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although I think you could have cropped the road in the foreground and still had leading lines from the fences to the house.</td>', 'Nice shot although I think you could have cropped the road in the foreground and still had leading lines from the fences to the house.', '2003-03-06 23:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(230871, 13429, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, I might have cropped a bit of the sky out though.</td>', 'Pretty cool, I might have cropped a bit of the sky out though.', '2003-03-06 23:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(230872, 13335, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot.  I wish the subject was stationary and not blurred though. Colors are great.</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot.  I wish the subject was stationary and not blurred though. Colors are great.', '2003-03-06 23:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(230873, 13204, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, I really like the composition.  Colors and focus and lighting all good.  Gotta be happy with that!</td>', 'Neat shot, I really like the composition.  Colors and focus and lighting all good.  Gotta be happy with that!', '2003-03-06 23:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(230874, 13442, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I would have cropped it down from the top to cut out the bright white in the top left corner and really made the subject pop out.</td>', 'Nice job!  I would have cropped it down from the top to cut out the bright white in the top left corner and really made the subject pop out.', '2003-03-06 23:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230876, 13422, 6325, '<td valign="top">More lines than I can count, but none take me in a particular direction.</td>', 'More lines than I can count, but none take me in a particular direction.', '2003-03-06 23:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230877, 13336, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but it would have been so much better if they were at the other side of the bridge!  Especially the one in orange!</td>', 'Great shot, but it would have been so much better if they were at the other side of the bridge!  Especially the one in orange!', '2003-03-06 23:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(230879, 13323, 3280, '<td valign="top">I think that if you were able to get the handle in focus, this would have been awesome.</td>', 'I think that if you were able to get the handle in focus, this would have been awesome.', '2003-03-06 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(230880, 13330, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice leading lines, fits the challenge, nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice leading lines, fits the challenge, nice shot.', '2003-03-06 23:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(230881, 13284, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the challenge and color.  The flowers seem just a bit soft on focus though.</td>', 'Nice use of the challenge and color.  The flowers seem just a bit soft on focus though.', '2003-03-06 23:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(230882, 13525, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, fits the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot, fits the challenge.', '2003-03-06 23:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(230885, 13388, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and color! One of the best examples this week.</td>', 'Nice use of light and color! One of the best examples this week.', '2003-03-06 23:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230888, 13470, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job, beautiful green. One of the few with a leading line!</td>', 'Nice job, beautiful green. One of the few with a leading line!', '2003-03-06 23:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(230889, 13285, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good job of leading line. The salt is nice and white too.</td>', 'Good job of leading line. The salt is nice and white too.', '2003-03-06 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(230890, 13337, 3280, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective, I think this is what the challenge was looking for!  Very nice job.</td>', 'Simple yet effective, I think this is what the challenge was looking for!  Very nice job.', '2003-03-06 23:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(230891, 13323, 4267, '<td valign="top">Yes! the lins lead to the subject, and you managed to get the dof to only focus on the subject. a double whammy! now thats what the challenge is about! great job, great lighting, and while the subject is not the most exciting, you made it interesting with the way you shot it! (10)</td>', 'Yes! the lins lead to the subject, and you managed to get the dof to only focus on the subject. a double whammy! now thats what the challenge is about! great job, great lighting, and while the subject is not the most exciting, you made it interesting with the way you shot it! (10)', '2003-03-06 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(230893, 13221, 3280, '<td valign="top">The Sparrow could have been just a wee bit better focused.  Nice lines though.</td>', 'The Sparrow could have been just a wee bit better focused.  Nice lines though.', '2003-03-06 23:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(230894, 13231, 4267, '<td valign="top">the truck seems to be the subject and the lines lead to a subject that is a small small part of the shot...  so it doesn''t meet the challenge for me... but, nice color on the sky, thats not always easy</td>', 'the truck seems to be the subject and the lines lead to a subject that is a small small part of the shot...  so it doesn''t meet the challenge for me... but, nice color on the sky, thats not always easy', '2003-03-06 23:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(230895, 13357, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Neat transformation of white to blue.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Nice job!  Neat transformation of white to blue.  I like this a lot.', '2003-03-06 23:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(230896, 13396, 3280, '<td valign="top">The color of the sky looks a bit off.  Good focus on the tower.</td>', 'The color of the sky looks a bit off.  Good focus on the tower.', '2003-03-06 23:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(230897, 13284, 4267, '<td valign="top">would be nicer if the bush was more in focus as thats where the lines lead us.. also, while there are lines leading to the subject, the vertical lines of the fence are pretty powerful as well and sort of take some power from the leading lines in the process... great composition for a shot though... good color and lighting</td>', 'would be nicer if the bush was more in focus as thats where the lines lead us.. also, while there are lines leading to the subject, the vertical lines of the fence are pretty powerful as well and sort of take some power from the leading lines in the process... great composition for a shot though... good color and lighting', '2003-03-06 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(230898, 13221, 4267, '<td valign="top">good use of lines to lead to the subject, just needs sharper focus on the subject</td>', 'good use of lines to lead to the subject, just needs sharper focus on the subject', '2003-03-06 23:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(230899, 13277, 4793, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot minus the dog!</td>', 'A wonderful shot minus the dog!', '2003-03-06 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230901, 13377, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, it seems like it may have worked even better if the flower were further into the top right corner.  And the stem leading out of the photo.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the shot, it seems like it may have worked even better if the flower were further into the top right corner.  And the stem leading out of the photo.  Good job.', '2003-03-06 23:21:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(230902, 13236, 4267, '<td valign="top">the lines are so subtle, they don;t really have enough power to give the leading lines effect. the eye itself holds enough power on it''s own to draw the viewers attention</td>', 'the lines are so subtle, they don;t really have enough power to give the leading lines effect. the eye itself holds enough power on it''s own to draw the viewers attention', '2003-03-06 23:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(230903, 13366, 4267, '<td valign="top">leading lines alright, but as the title says, they lead to nowhere, or no main subject..  while nothing is the subject, it''s well, not much of a subject for me... this would be better suited for the rythym challenge</td>', 'leading lines alright, but as the title says, they lead to nowhere, or no main subject..  while nothing is the subject, it''s well, not much of a subject for me... this would be better suited for the rythym challenge', '2003-03-06 23:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(230904, 13349, 4267, '<td valign="top">jagged lines, but lines nonetheless.. and they lead right where they should, to the subject.. good effort, nice lighting and color</td>', 'jagged lines, but lines nonetheless.. and they lead right where they should, to the subject.. good effort, nice lighting and color', '2003-03-06 23:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(230905, 13337, 4267, '<td valign="top">good idea, and lighting, but bring the cans closer in so we get a better view of the as the main subject... so far in the corner the lines hold more subject power than they should</td>', 'good idea, and lighting, but bring the cans closer in so we get a better view of the as the main subject... so far in the corner the lines hold more subject power than they should', '2003-03-06 23:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(230908, 13525, 6182, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea...I think it would work better for this topic if the path ended more in the middle of the shot.   This format draws your eye into and through and out of your shot instead of leading your eye into a subject.   I like the black and white but think it would be better with more contrast.</td>', 'Interesting idea...I think it would work better for this topic if the path ended more in the middle of the shot.   This format draws your eye into and through and out of your shot instead of leading your eye into a subject.   I like the black and white but think it would be better with more contrast.', '2003-03-06 23:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(230909, 13204, 6182, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...fun idea.   Some of the more literal in this contest might suggest that there is a lack of the linear in this but I would definitely disagree.   I like the subtlety and love the colors!</td>', 'Nice shot...fun idea.   Some of the more literal in this contest might suggest that there is a lack of the linear in this but I would definitely disagree.   I like the subtlety and love the colors!', '2003-03-06 23:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(230912, 13454, 6182, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot!  <br/>This is definitely one of the best at meeting the challenge!</td>', 'Really beautiful shot!  This is definitely one of the best at meeting the challenge!', '2003-03-06 23:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(230914, 13388, 6182, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this picture.  it definitely meets the challenge, nice use of lines and light to draw the viewers eye into the subject.  to make it a winner, you probably need a better model...i don''t know what it is about her, but she''s not convincing in this role and she needs a fashion consultant.</td>', 'Overall I like this picture.  it definitely meets the challenge, nice use of lines and light to draw the viewers eye into the subject.  to make it a winner, you probably need a better model...i don''t know what it is about her, but she''s not convincing in this role and she needs a fashion consultant.', '2003-03-06 23:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(230915, 13455, 6182, '<td valign="top">Nice shot....cool idea.    Would be better with better light but what are you to do when dealing with natural light, you take what you get!   This looks a lot like the northern Virginia country side...i''d be interested to know where this is.</td>', 'Nice shot....cool idea.    Would be better with better light but what are you to do when dealing with natural light, you take what you get!   This looks a lot like the northern Virginia country side...i''d be interested to know where this is.', '2003-03-06 23:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230916, 13490, 6182, '<td valign="top">Very fun, interesting idea!   I like the colors and the twisting lines, I probably would have taken a closer shot and tried to figure out how to get a straight line to lead into the curves somehow.    The strong lines at the top right keep my eyes from lingering on the curves...they have a tendency to shoot your eye right through that corner...in and out!    Fun idea though...worth exploring some more i think!</td>', 'Very fun, interesting idea!   I like the colors and the twisting lines, I probably would have taken a closer shot and tried to figure out how to get a straight line to lead into the curves somehow.    The strong lines at the top right keep my eyes from lingering on the curves...they have a tendency to shoot your eye right through that corner...in and out!    Fun idea though...worth exploring some more i think!', '2003-03-06 23:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(230919, 13217, 6202, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo!</td>', 'Fantastic photo!', '2003-03-06 23:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(230995, 13470, 1019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Landscape with unusual leading lines--an excellent shot</td>', 'Beautiful Landscape with unusual leading lines--an excellent shot', '2003-03-07 01:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(230996, 13277, 1019, '<td valign="top">Unusual and interesting--good composition --well done</td>', 'Unusual and interesting--good composition --well done', '2003-03-07 01:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(231001, 13335, 1019, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic with strong lines and colour. I like the soft ghostlike subject--I wonder how this looked in natural colours of black and white---well done</td>', 'Very dramatic with strong lines and colour. I like the soft ghostlike subject--I wonder how this looked in natural colours of black and white---well done', '2003-03-07 01:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(231002, 13454, 1019, '<td valign="top">A beautiful landscape with reflections--good leading lines  a lovely shot</td>', 'A beautiful landscape with reflections--good leading lines  a lovely shot', '2003-03-07 01:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(231004, 13489, 1019, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and colours disapearing into the blue water--very strong--good design</td>', 'I like the textures and colours disapearing into the blue water--very strong--good design', '2003-03-07 01:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(231006, 13337, 1019, '<td valign="top">Excellent design and very dramatic contrasts</td>', 'Excellent design and very dramatic contrasts', '2003-03-07 01:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(231007, 13267, 1019, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition--strong image</td>', 'Lovely composition--strong image', '2003-03-07 01:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(231009, 13204, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good diagonal composition--the leading lines are the focus</td>', 'Good diagonal composition--the leading lines are the focus', '2003-03-07 01:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(231011, 13350, 1019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines leading into the mist--well done</td>', 'Beautiful lines leading into the mist--well done', '2003-03-07 01:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(231014, 13293, 1019, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about the leading lines but I so love this photo that I dont care!</td>', 'I am not sure about the leading lines but I so love this photo that I dont care!', '2003-03-07 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(231016, 13299, 1019, '<td valign="top">Powerful portrait</td>', 'Powerful portrait', '2003-03-07 01:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(231034, 13236, 5212, '<td valign="top">I like the unique way you met the challenge, and I love cat photos.  The lower right seems a little overexposed, I''m assuming it''s more of the cat''s face, but a bit hard to interpret.  7</td>', 'I like the unique way you met the challenge, and I love cat photos.  The lower right seems a little overexposed, I''m assuming it''s more of the cat''s face, but a bit hard to interpret.  7', '2003-03-07 02:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(231035, 13469, 5212, '<td valign="top">There are lots of leading lines here, good work!</td>', 'There are lots of leading lines here, good work!', '2003-03-07 02:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(231037, 13201, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot.  7</td>', 'Very nice macro shot.  7', '2003-03-07 02:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(231064, 13312, 6100, '<td valign="top">The lines are very subtle here but here nonetheless and they do a good job. I would like to see the horizon level, though.</td>', 'The lines are very subtle here but here nonetheless and they do a good job. I would like to see the horizon level, though.', '2003-03-07 07:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(231072, 13217, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great shot! My top of the week! The duo tone hasn''t been exagerated and the light and dark tones are well balanced. Your cropping is perfect! Theme well respected!</td>', 'Great shot! My top of the week! The duo tone hasn''t been exagerated and the light and dark tones are well balanced. Your cropping is perfect! Theme well respected!', '2003-03-07 08:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(231073, 13357, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great shot! My 9 of the week! The desaturation enhances the leading lines to theblue sky. One thing I would change since the side walls aren''t symetrical is the cropping. I would crop it more to either side because right now is has an unnatural "unbalance".  :-)</td>', 'Great shot! My 9 of the week! The desaturation enhances the leading lines to theblue sky. One thing I would change since the side walls aren''t symetrical is the cropping. I would crop it more to either side because right now is has an unnatural "unbalance".  :-)', '2003-03-07 08:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(231074, 13396, 4482, '<td valign="top">An 8 from me! Respects the theme and the focus and lighting are spot on. I really enjoy the dark blue sky and how it contrasts with the tower. I''m glad you didn''t center it but I would''ve moved it a bit more to the left.</td>', 'An 8 from me! Respects the theme and the focus and lighting are spot on. I really enjoy the dark blue sky and how it contrasts with the tower. I''m glad you didn''t center it but I would''ve moved it a bit more to the left.', '2003-03-07 08:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(231076, 13204, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The angle adds to the depth of the photo. The ocolors are great as is your WB. After re-eval... from an 8 to a 9!  :-)</td>', 'Great shot! The angle adds to the depth of the photo. The ocolors are great as is your WB. After re-eval... from an 8 to a 9!  :-)', '2003-03-07 08:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(231077, 13350, 4482, '<td valign="top">WOW! What a great bridge shot this would make! ;-P<br/> <br/>It represents the theme well and the B&amp;W works well... it gives it a sense of mystery with the mist. Your croping is spot on!</td>', 'WOW! What a great bridge shot this would make! ;-P It represents the theme well and the B&W works well... it gives it a sense of mystery with the mist. Your croping is spot on!', '2003-03-07 08:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(231079, 13525, 4482, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective! In my top 10 of the week! Your cropping is spo on. The lightness of the walkway contrasts well with the dark brush around it and keeps your focus on the path. 8</td>', 'Simple yet effective! In my top 10 of the week! Your cropping is spo on. The lightness of the walkway contrasts well with the dark brush around it and keeps your focus on the path. 8', '2003-03-07 08:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(231081, 13285, 4482, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm this smells like a Rackat photo but I can''t be sure  ;-) The attention to detail makes this otherwise simple shot work! A little over-ex on the salt. The angle adds depth and you respected the theme. The colors are great!</td>', 'Hmmmmm this smells like a Rackat photo but I can''t be sure  ;-) The attention to detail makes this otherwise simple shot work! A little over-ex on the salt. The angle adds depth and you respected the theme. The colors are great!', '2003-03-07 08:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(231083, 13335, 4482, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmm.... After careful consideration... from a 7 to an 8. :-) Great shot but IMO the blue duotone is a bit too strong with this type of architecture. A softer, more subtle blue would''ve given it more impact. The angle is great and the fact that the person isn''t well defined got me looking closer... it caught my attention!</td>', 'Hmmmmmm.... After careful consideration... from a 7 to an 8. :-) Great shot but IMO the blue duotone is a bit too strong with this type of architecture. A softer, more subtle blue would''ve given it more impact. The angle is great and the fact that the person isn''t well defined got me looking closer... it caught my attention!', '2003-03-07 08:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(231084, 13210, 4482, '<td valign="top">This was for the cliché challenge.</td>', 'This was for the cliché challenge.', '2003-03-07 08:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(231085, 13236, 4482, '<td valign="top">This was for the cliché challenge. 1</td>', 'This was for the cliché challenge. 1', '2003-03-07 08:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(231086, 13287, 4482, '<td valign="top">For the life of me.. where are the leading lines??? Sorry doesn''t work for me at all.</td>', 'For the life of me.. where are the leading lines??? Sorry doesn''t work for me at all.', '2003-03-07 08:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(231088, 13368, 4482, '<td valign="top">Yes, there are lines.... unfortunately they don''t lead anywhere.  :-)</td>', 'Yes, there are lines.... unfortunately they don''t lead anywhere.  :-)', '2003-03-07 08:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
