(232717, 13420, 3599, '<td valign="top">The slant and the soft focus were intentional, hence the title soft light.  I tried for a more focused picture and it looked bad.  The cord was too sharp taking away from the lamp so I went with soft focus.  I think this is one of my better works but I guess most of you didn''t like it.  Oh well.  BTW, thanks for all of the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-10 08:14:55.</i></td>', 'The slant and the soft focus were intentional, hence the title soft light.  I tried for a more focused picture and it looked bad.  The cord was too sharp taking away from the lamp so I went with soft focus.  I think this is one of my better works but I guess most of you didn''t like it.  Oh well.  BTW, thanks for all of the comments.', '2003-03-10 08:14:06.000000', '2003-03-10 08:14:55.000000', 0),
